<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-111" chapter-id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou" source-id="s-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou">
  <p id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:army" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">晉大司馬<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:army:m0004" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>、江州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:army:m0011" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">桓沖</persName>、豫州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:army:m0018" ref="2c9_218_9b3">袁真</persName>率眾五萬伐<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:army:m0025" ref="796_d68_593">暐</persName>，</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>部將<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0003" ref="f29_d98_26c">檀玄</persName>攻胡陸，執<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0010" ref="796_d68_593">暐</persName>甯東<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0013" ref="eet_b7g_za7">慕容忠</persName>。<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0017" ref="796_d68_593">暐</persName>遣其將<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0021" ref="ac1_d86_205">慕容厲</persName>與<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0025" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>戰于黃墟，<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:hulu:m0031" ref="ac1_d86_205">厲</persName>師大敗，單馬奔還。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>前鋒<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0003" ref="qad_k9o_71k">硃序</persName>又破<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0007" ref="796_d68_593">暐</persName>將<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0009" ref="wse_ygh_z6q">傅顏</persName>于林渚，<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0015" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>軍大振，次於枋頭。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:xiangyi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:xiangyi:m0000" ref="van_pwm_swv">德</persName>率勁騎四千，先<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:xiangyi:m0008" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>至襄邑東，伏於澗中，與<persName id="c-jinshu-111-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:xiangyi:m0020" ref="t7y_8p2_aeb">垂</persName>前後夾擊，王師大敗，死者三萬餘人。</p>
</text>
